WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.290
(mellow music)

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:04.160
- There's not a face for every culture,

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:07.600
every ethnicity, every race.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.790
So when you're telling me that
I'm too dark to be Dominican,

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:13.000
show me what a Dominican looks like.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.750
And then try to tell me that
I'm not Dominican enough,

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:16.800
because you're wrong.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.630
I'm Dominican; I'm Black;
I'm an Afro-Latina;

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:22.648
and you can't tell me any different.

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:25.231
(upbeat music)

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:34.380
An Afro-Latina is simply a
person who just identifies

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:36.400
with their Blackness, that's it.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.130
I'm a Black girl, and my family
is from Dominican Republic.

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:42.830
But people say I'm too
dark to be Dominican.

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:45.920
People say I can't be Latina.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:48.060
Growing up there was no
one who looked like me.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:50.310
I remember just being called charcoal.

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:52.190
I remember being called too dirty.

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:53.970
At one point, I stopped
saying I was Dominican.

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:56.930
My goal is simply to be
able to help the youth

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:59.584
feel comfortable in their skin and own it.

00:00:59.584 --> 00:01:01.070
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:02.085
Hello.

00:01:02.085 --> 00:01:04.690
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:07.590
Most people know me as
MonicaStyleMuse over on YouTube,

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:09.060
Instagram, you name it.

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.090
I've been able to be extremely
successful as an Afro-Latina

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:13.250
in the beauty space.

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:15.270
This is one of my favorite eyebrow pencils

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:17.280
because the precision
just makes your brows,

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:19.080
you know I live for a brow lift.

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:20.330
I'm not the best makeup artist,

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:22.020
and never did I ever say I was,

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:25.800
but, I feel like if I can at
least just inspire other people

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:27.050
to just live in their own truth

00:01:27.050 --> 00:01:29.120
regardless of what other people think.

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:31.383
- I know her cause I
follow her on Instagram.

00:01:32.255 --> 00:01:34.517
- Oh, she likes me.
- I like her.

00:01:34.517 --> 00:01:36.080
- I’m cool!

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:39.420
It took me maybe three
years to really find myself

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:41.130
and to be my own muse on my channel.

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:42.650
You can put this all over your face

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:44.680
to really bring the
moisture back into your face,

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:46.610
so you look refreshed.

00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:48.310
One day I just decided, you know what,

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:49.314
I'm gonna be myself.

00:01:49.314 --> 00:01:52.190
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:54.360
At first when I started
speaking Spanish on my channel,

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:55.860
they were like, can you stop this?

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:57.560
Can you just make a separate channel?

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:58.870
And I said you know what, no.

00:01:58.870 --> 00:01:59.930
This is who I am,

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:02.500
and it was the best decision
I've ever made for myself.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:05.670
Being a Latina means knowing
that you have a culture

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:08.100
and a background and a story

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:09.910
that can't also be taken from you.

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:13.620
My audience is this sassy person

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:15.760
who is just so ready to take on

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:17.490
whatever the world throws at them.

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:19.490
They're gonna figure it
out one way or another,

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:21.033
and that's what I've done.

00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:24.930
Even like thinking back to little Monica,

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:26.490
baby Monica was so timid.

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:28.040
She was so scared of the world.

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.779
I'm an adult now; you
can't really phase me.

00:02:30.779 --> 00:02:32.340
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:35.596
Which means, if my shine bothers
you, that's not my problem.

00:02:35.596 --> 00:02:38.179
(gentle music)

